---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | D.Lab Experts"
  description="How D.Lab Experts collects, uses and protects personal data, in line with Brazil's LGPD data-protection law."
  locale="en"
>
  <section class="priv-section">
    <div class="container priv-wrap">
      <span class="priv-eyebrow">Privacy · LGPD</span>
      <h1 class="priv-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="priv-lead">
        This policy explains, in plain language, how D.Lab Experts handles the
        personal data collected on this site, under Brazil's General Data
        Protection Law (LGPD, Law No. 13,709/2018). <!-- DRAFT: review with legal. -->
      </p>

      <h2>What data we collect</h2>
      <p>
        We collect the <strong>email address</strong> you provide when unlocking
        content or getting in touch, plus anonymous browsing data (analytics)
        used only to improve the site.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        To deliver the content you requested, respond to your message, and send
        D.Lab materials and updates — always with the option to unsubscribe at
        any time.
      </p>

      <h2>Legal basis and consent</h2>
      <p>
        Email communications are sent based on your explicit
        <strong>consent</strong>, given when you check the opt-in box. You can
        withdraw that consent whenever you like.
      </p>

      <h2>Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell your data. We use email and form processors (e.g.
        Formspree) solely to operate the capture and delivery of messages.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your data, as
        well as revoke consent, by emailing
        <a href="mailto:gabriel@dlabexperts.com">gabriel@dlabexperts.com</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="priv-updated">Last updated: 2026. <!-- DRAFT: confirm date and legal review. --></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .priv-section { padding: 150px 0 100px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .priv-wrap { max-width: 720px; }
  .priv-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .16em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .priv-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 52px); letter-spacing: -.03em;
    line-height: 1.06; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .priv-lead { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .priv-wrap h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: -.02em; color: var(--ink); margin: 28px 0 10px;
  }
  .priv-wrap p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .priv-wrap strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .priv-wrap a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; }
  .priv-updated { margin-top: 36px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-dim); }
</style>
